    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aaxaas, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaxaas markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray labaatan sannadood, oo lix iyo toban sannadood ayuu Yeruusaalem boqor ku ahaa, oo isagu ma uu samayn sidii awowgiis Daa'uud oo kale wax Rabbiga hortiisa ku qumman, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse wuxuu ku socday jidadkii boqorrada dalka Israa'iil, oo weliba wuxuu Bacaliim u sameeyey sanamyo la shubay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana foox buu ku shiday dooxadii ina Hinnom, oo carruurtiisiina dab buu ku dhex gubay, sidii ay ahayd karaahiyadii quruumihii Rabbigu ka eryay reer binu Israa'iil hortooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu ku allabaryi jiray oo fooxna ku shidi jiray meelihii sarsare, iyo buuraha dushooda, iyo geed kasta oo dheer oo doog ah hoostiisaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaa Rabbiga Ilaahiisa ahu isagii ku riday gacantii boqorkii Suuriya, oo intay isagii wax ku dhufteen ayay dadkiisii tirada badnaana maxaabiis ahaan ugu kaxaysteen Dimishaq. Oo haddana isagii waxaa gacanta loo geliyey boqorkii dalka Israa'iil kaasoo wax badan ka laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Feqax ina Remalyaah ayaa dalka Yahuudah isku maalin ku laayay boqol iyo labaatan kun oo nin oo dhammaantood wada xoog badan, maxaa yeelay, iyagu waxay ka tageen Rabbigii ahaa Ilaahii awowayaashood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sikrii oo ahaa nin xoog badan oo reer Efrayim ayaa dilay Macaseeyaah oo ahaa boqorka wiilkiisii, iyo Casriiqaam oo reerka u talin jiray, iyo Elqaanaah oo ahaa kii boqorka ku xigay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Israa'iilna waxay walaalahood maxaabiis ahaan uga soo kaxaysteen laba boqol oo kun oo qof, oo ahaa naago iyo wiilal iyo gabdhoba, oo waxay kaloo ka dhaceen maal badan, oo maalkiina waxay keeneen Samaariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse halkaas waxaa joogay nebi Rabbigu soo dirtay, oo magiciisana waxaa la odhan jiray Codeed, wuuna u baxay inuu ka hor tago ciidankii Samaariya ku soo socday oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Bal eega, Rabbiga ah Ilaahii awowayaashiin ayaa u cadhooday dadka Yahuudah, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayuu iyaga gacantiinna u soo geliyey, oo idinna waxaad iyagii ku layseen cadho kulul oo tan iyo samada gaadhay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo imminka waxaad ku talo jirtaan inaad hoosaysiisaan dadka Yahuudah iyo dadka Yeruusaalem si ay idiinku ahaadaan niman addoommo ah iyo naago addoommo ah, laakiinse miyaanay jirin xadgudubyo aad idinkuba ku xadgudubteen Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba i maqla, oo celiya maxaabiistii aad walaalihiin ka soo kaxaysateen, maxaa yeelay, waxaa idin kor saaran Rabbiga cadhadiisa kulul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay madaxdii reer Efrayim qaarkood hor istaageen kuwii dagaalka ka soo noqday, oo madaxdaasuna waxay ahaayeen Casaryaah ina Yooxaanaan, iyo Berekyaah ina Meshilleemood, iyo Yexisqiyaah ina Shalluum, iyo Camaasaa ina Xadlay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay iyagii ku yidhaahdeen, Idinku waa inaydnaan maxaabiista halkan soo gelin, waayo, waxaad ku talo jirtaan inaad ina kor saartaan xadgudub Rabbiga ka gees ah, oo waxaad inoo sii kordhinaysaan dembiyadeennii iyo xadgudubkeennii, maxaa yeelay, xadgudubkeennu aad buu u weyn yahay, oo dadka Israa'iilna aad baa loogu cadhooday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed raggii hubka sitay waxay maxaabiistii iyo boolidiiba kaga tageen amiirrada iyo shirkii oo dhan hortooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay nimankii la magacaabay soo kaceen, oo waxay qabteen maxaabiistii, oo kuwii dhexdooda ku jiray oo qaawanaana dhar bay uga xidheen boolidii, wax bay huwiyeen, oo kabana way u geliyeen, oo waxay siiyeen wax ay cunaan iyo wax ay cabbaanba, wayna u subkeen, oo kuwii itaalka yaraa oo dhanna dameeray ku qaadeen, markaasay Yerixoo oo ahayd magaaladii geedatimireedka lahayd walaalahood ugu geeyeen, dabadeedna Samaariya ayay ku noqdeen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas ayaa Boqor Aaxaas u cid dirsaday boqorradii reer Ashuur inay caawiyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waxaa haddana yimid reer Edom oo intay dalka Yahuudah wax ku dhufteen ayay dadkoodii maxaabiis ahaan u kaxaysteen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba reer Falastiinna waxay weerareen magaalooyinkii dooxada iyo kuwii dalka Yahuudah ee Koonfureed, oo waxay qabsadeen Beytshemesh, iyo Ayaaloon, iyo Gedeerood, iyo Sookoo iyo tuulooyinkeedii, iyo Timnaah iyo tuulooyinkeedii, iyo weliba Gimsoo iyo tuulooyinkeedii, oo intaas oo dhanna way iska degeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu dadka Yahuudah hoos ugu dejiyey boqorkii dalka Israa'iil oo Aaxaas ahaa daraaddiis, maxaa yeelay, si xun buu dalka Yahuudah ugu dhex macaamilooday, oo Rabbigana aad buu ugu xadgudbay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa isagii u yimid Tilgad Filneser oo ahaa boqorkii Ashuur, oo isna aad buu u dhibay, mana uu caawin isagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Aaxaas qayb ka soo qaaday gurigii Rabbiga iyo gurigii boqorka iyo kii amiirradaba, oo wuxuu siiyey boqorkii Ashuur, laakiinse taasu isagii waxba uma tarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Boqor Aaxaas kaas qudhiisu intuu dhibaataysnaa ayuu weliba Rabbiga si weyn ugu sii xadgudbay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, isagu wuxuu allabari u bixiyey ilaahyadii Dimishaq oo isaga wax ku dhuftay, oo wuxuu isyidhi, Ilaahyada boqorrada reer Suuriya way caawiyaan iyaga, sidaas daraaddeed allabari ayaan u bixinayaa si ay anigana ii caawiyaan. Laakiinse waxay isaga iyo reer binu Israa'iil oo dhanba u noqdeen wax ay ku dhacaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Aaxaas wuxuu soo wada urursaday weelashii guriga Ilaah oo wuu wada burburiyey weelashii guriga Ilaah, oo albaabbadii guriga Rabbigana wuu wada xidhay, oo isna wuxuu meelo allabari ka samaystay gees kasta oo Yeruusaalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo magaaloo kasta oo dalka Yahuudahna wuxuu ka dhisay meelo sarsare in foox loogu shido ilaahyo qalaad, oo wuxuu aad uga xanaajiyey Rabbigii ahaa Ilaahii awowayaashiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba falimihiisii kale iyo jidadkiisii oo dhammu intii hore iyo intii dambeba waxay ku wada qoran yihiin kitaabkii boqorrada dalka Yahuudah iyo dalka Israa'iil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Aaxaas dhintay oo la seexday awowayaashiis, oo waxaa lagu aasay magaalada Yeruusaalem, waayo, isagii lama gelin qabuurihii boqorrada dalka Israa'iil; oo meeshiisiina waxaa boqor ka noqday wiilkiisii Xisqiyaah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
